==Strategy==
This stage is difficult since if you let Codename "Red Riding" get more than 1/5th of the way to the base she will be able to snipe it with her LD range. Thus, you must either prevent her from advancing to that point, or rush her with strong attackers that can take her down before she takes your base down.

You can cheese this stage fairly easy on higher crowns if you have the correct units. Start by deploying a [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] to kill the early peons, creating the perfect route for [[Green Shell Cat|Green Shell]] to move to the frontline. If done correctly, it should be standing right in front of Mina and stopping her from moving. After that, spam [[Courier Cat|Courier Cats]] or any other units with LD to destroy the base. Green Shell should block the [[H. Nah|H. Nahs]] from damaging your attackers. You may need to use Defense up [[Combo|combos]]. If you feel like this strategy is too hard to follow or your Green Shell dies too quickly, you can spawn [[Talents|Talented]] [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to kill the H. Nahs, leaving Mina vulnerable. By the time the [[Le'noir]]s and [[Sunfish Jones]] arrived, the enemy's base should have been very low, not allowing them to ruin your day.

